
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Bright Future College</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: #f8f7f2;
      color: #182b49;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 22px 8%;
      background: white;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px #0000000a;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #ed6537;
    }

    nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #182b49;
      margin-left: 25px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #ed6537;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 540px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 35px;
      padding: 70px 8%;
      background: #f2e8d8;
    }

    .hero-content {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .tag {
      color: #ed6537;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 68px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #526078;
      max-width: 480px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #ed6537;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: #cf4e25;
    }

    .hero-image {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .hero-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 360px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 75px 8%;
    }

    .section-heading {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      color: #657087;
    }

    .courses {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .course-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #182b4910;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .course-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-7px);
    }

    .course-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 210px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .course-info {
      padding: 23px;
    }

    .course-info h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .course-info p {
      color: #657087;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .campus {
      background: #182b49;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .campus p {
      color: #d3dbe7;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 15px auto;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .stat h3 {
      color: #ff936c;
      font-size: 35px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .admission {
      text-align: center;
      background: #fce5d8;
    }

    .admission p {
      margin-top: 15px;
      color: #526078;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 28px 8%;
      text-align: center;
      background: #101e34;
      color: white;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      header {
        padding: 20px 5%;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 15px;
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      nav a {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .hero {
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 55px 6%;
      }

      .hero-image {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .hero-image img {
        height: 280px;
      }

      .courses {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .stats {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      section {
        padding: 55px 6%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">BrightFuture.</div>

    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
      <a href="#campus">Campus</a>
      <a href="#admission">Admissions</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="tag">Learn · Grow · Succeed</span>
        <h1>Your Future<br>Starts Here.</h1>
        <p>
          Discover your potential, explore new opportunities,
          and build the skills to shape a brighter future at
          Bright Future College.
        </p>
        <a href="#admission" class="btn">Apply Now →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-image">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523050854058-8df90110c9f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85"
          alt="College students celebrating on campus">
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="courses">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Explore Our Courses</h2>
        <p>Find your passion and turn it into your career.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="courses">
        <article class="course-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
            alt="Computer and technology studies">
          <div class="course-info">
            <h3>Computer Science</h3>
            <p>Learn programming, software development,
              artificial intelligence, and modern technology.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="course-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
            alt="Business students working together">
          <div class="course-info">
            <h3>Business Management</h3>
            <p>Build leadership, entrepreneurship,
              communication, and business strategy skills.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="course-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513364776144-60967b0f800f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
            alt="Art and creative design materials">
          <div class="course-info">
            <h3>Arts & Design</h3>
            <p>Explore visual communication, creative thinking,
              graphic design, and artistic expression.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="campus" id="campus">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>More Than Just a College</h2>
        <p>Learn together. Create together. Grow together.</p>
      </div>

      <p>
        Experience a welcoming campus filled with inspiring
        teachers, student activities, collaborative spaces,
        and opportunities to discover what you love.
      </p>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <h3>25+</h3>
          <p>Academic Programs</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <h3>5,000+</h3>
          <p>Students</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <h3>100+</h3>
          <p>Expert Faculty</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="admission" id="admission">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Ready to Begin Your Journey?</h2>
        <p>Take the first step toward your dreams today.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:admissions@example.com">
          Contact Admissions
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Bright Future College. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
